@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Flujo de Datos: Monitor Draeger -> Adaptador Headless -> Red DDS -> Supervisor UI

actor "Monitor\nDraeger\n(Hardware)" as Hw

box "Headless Adapter (Raspberry Pi)" #f5f5f5
participant "RTMedibus / Medibus\n(InputStream)" as Parser
participant "AbstractDraegerVent\n(Device Adapter)" as Vent
participant "DDS DataWriter\n(Publisher)" as Writer
end box

box "Supervisor (PC / Interfaz Gráfica)" #e8f4f8
participant "DDS DataReader\n(Subscriber)" as Reader
participant "MDSHandler /\nDeviceListModel" as MDS
participant "Componentes UI\n(JavaFX)" as UI
end box

== 1. Lectura Física y Decodificación (Protocolo Medibus) ==

Hw -> Parser: Bytes crudos (ej. 0x24 + payload de Frecuencia Cardíaca)
activate Parser
Parser -> Parser: Lee encabezado, longitud\ny verifica Checksum
Parser -> Parser: Traduce hex a Java Objects\n(buscando en command.map / draeger.map)
Parser -> Vent: receiveMeasuredData(CP1, Data[])
deactivate Parser

== 2. Estandarización y Procesamiento OpenICE ==

activate Vent
Vent -> Vent: Busca el nombre estandarizado (metric_id)\n(ej. MDC_PULS_OXIM_PULS_RATE)
Vent -> Vent: numericSample(InstanceHolder, value, timestamp)
Vent -> Writer: write(Numeric, InstanceHandle_t)
deactivate Vent

== 3. Transporte por el Middleware DDS ==

Writer -> Reader: Multicast/Unicast UDP (Protocolo RTPS)\n[Tópico DDS: "ice::Numeric"]

== 4. Recepción y Renderizado en el Supervisor ==

activate Reader
Reader -> MDS: on_data_available()\n(Evento disparado por RTI DDS)
deactivate Reader

activate MDS
MDS -> MDS: Verifica de qué equipo viene el dato\n(usa el Unique Device Identifier - UDI)
MDS -> MDS: Extrae valor, unidades y timestamp
MDS -> UI: Notifica a los Listeners de datos numéricos\n(Platform.runLater para evitar colisión de hilos)
deactivate MDS

activate UI
UI -> UI: Actualiza textos, gráficos o tablas en pantalla\n(Panel del Paciente)
deactivate UI

@enduml
